Prerequisites:
node.js

Setup:
1. create a .env file in the project root:
DATABASE_URL="file:./dev.db"
2. Install dependencies
npm install
3. Set up the database
npx prisma generate
npx prisma migrate deploy
--resolve
cmd /c npx prisma migrate resolve --applied 20260412072940_add_order_log
4. Seed the database (load default data, skip if u want fresh db)
npx prisma db seed
5. Run 
npm run dev

